<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson signs 960mln skr Russian axe deal.</title>
<headline>Ericsson signs 960mln skr Russian axe deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms company L.M. Ericsson said on Thursday it signed a letter of intention with Russia's Svyazinvest, a Russian investment company, for the delivery of AXE switching equipment and services in 1997-98.</p>
</text>
